AraunaPorto_Text_CiroTravelPrompt::
	.string "The coast road is open.\p"
	.string "PORTO DAS REDES is using the\n"
	.string "old southern landing.\p"
	.string "Travel there now?$"

AraunaPorto_Text_CiroStay::
	.string "CIRO: I will wait here.\n"
	.string "Tell me when you are ready.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_FisherArrival::
	.string "This beach is the old landing\n"
	.string "of PORTO DAS REDES.\p"
	.string "DONA ZILA waits in the city.\n"
	.string "She remembers every tide.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_FisherRiverWarning::
	.string "The river meets the sea here.\p"
	.string "Its water has turned pale, and\n"
	.string "the fishing songs went quiet.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_FisherAfterTestimony::
	.string "The color reached the sea again.\p"
	.string "Whatever answered that song,\n"
	.string "the whole port felt it.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_IaracoDistant::
	.string "A pale figure watches from the\n"
	.string "edge of the water, then hides.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_IaracoFirstMeeting::
	.string "IARACO appears without color.\p"
	.string "Its song breaks into fragments,\n"
	.string "as if a verse was erased.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_IaracoNeedsStory::
	.string "IARACO tries to sing.\p"
	.string "The missing verse feels older\n"
	.string "than the port itself.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_IaracoRestored::
	.string "DONA ZILA's story crosses the\n"
	.string "water in your voice.\p"
	.string "Color returns to IARACO.\n"
	.string "Its complete song rises.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_IaraMaeTestimony::
	.string "IARA-MAE answers the song.\p"
	.string "The river clears from its source\n"
	.string "all the way to the sea.\p"
	.string "Her presence is recorded as the\n"
	.string "first TESTIMONY.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_IaracoCalm::
	.string "IARACO sings with the tide.\n"
	.string "The water keeps its color.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaZilaIntroduction::
	.string "DONA ZILA: You came by the old\n"
	.string "landing, then.\p"
	.string "Our river is losing its color.\n"
	.string "Find the silent singer south\n"
	.string "of the city and listen first.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaZilaWaiting::
	.string "DONA ZILA: The singer stays near\n"
	.string "the northern end of the beach.\p"
	.string "Do not demand a song.\n"
	.string "Listen to what is missing.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaZilaCarameloStory::
	.string "DONA ZILA: On the flood night,\n"
	.string "CARAMELO carried one ember\n"
	.string "from door to door.\p"
	.string "The lamps stayed lit until every\n"
	.string "family reached high ground.\p"
	.string "Carry that memory to IARACO.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaZilaQueroStory::
	.string "DONA ZILA: QUERO cried through\n"
	.string "the whole flood night.\p"
	.string "Its warning woke every house\n"
	.string "before the river took the road.\p"
	.string "Carry that warning to IARACO.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaZilaPimpauStory::
	.string "DONA ZILA: When the riverside\n"
	.string "trees fell, PIMPAU carved every\n"
	.string "lost name into stone.\p"
	.string "The forest was remembered.\p"
	.string "Carry those names to IARACO.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaZilaReturnToRiver::
	.string "DONA ZILA: Now return the story\n"
	.string "to the silent singer.\p"
	.string "A remembered name can restore\n"
	.string "what silence tried to erase.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_MareTrialInvitation::
	.string "DONA ZILA: The river is calm,\n"
	.string "but a keeper must stand firm.\p"
	.string "Complete the TIDE VIGIL.\n"
	.string "Read each change in the current\n"
	.string "and protect your bond.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_MareTrialBattleIntro::
	.string "ZILA: Let the landing test\n"
	.string "what your bond can carry!$"

AraunaPorto_Text_MareTrialBattleDefeated::
	.string "ZILA: You bent with the tide\n"
	.string "without losing your course.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_MareTrialComplete::
	.string "The old landing answers your\n"
	.string "steady step.\p"
	.string "The TIDE VIGIL is complete.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaZilaAwardBadge::
	.string "DONA ZILA: IARA-MAE chose to be\n"
	.string "remembered through you.\p"
	.string "PORTO DAS REDES recognizes your\n"
	.string "care for the river.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_MareBadgeReceived::
	.string "{PLAYER} received the\n"
	.string "MARE BADGE!\p"
	.string "One HOUSE OF STORY now carries\n"
	.string "your name beside its own.$"

AraunaPorto_Text_DonaZilaAfterBadge::
	.string "DONA ZILA: The river remembers.\p"
	.string "Your next road climbs toward\n"
	.string "SERRA DO UIVO.$"
